Ge</surname> <given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Chuang</surname> <given-names>YY</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Zhao</surname> <given-names>S</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Tong</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Tsai</surname> <given-names>MH</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Temenak</surname> <given-names>JJ</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Comparative genomics of <italic>Rickettsia prowazekii</italic> Madrid E and Breinl strains.</article-title><source>J Bacteriol</source> <year>2004</year>;<volume>186</volume>:<fpage>556</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>65</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JB.186.2.556-565.2004</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14702324</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R14"><label>14. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Ge</surname> <given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Tong</surname> <given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Jiang</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Dasch</surname> <given-names>GA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Richards</surname> <given-names>AL</given-names></string-name> <article-title>Genotypic comparison of five isolates of <italic>Rickettsia prowazekii</italic> by multilocus sequence typing.</article-title><source>FEMS Microbiol Lett</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>271</volume>:<fpage>112</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>7</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1574-6968.2007.00706.x</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17419766</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>